"message":"李文秀：And a story that let your men carry away our food.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:32.4639138\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1148,"kind":"dialogue","message":"瓦耳拉齐：A good story opens more doors than a good lockpick.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:32.4714940\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1149,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：Then you can tell it to the guards. Father Perez has gone to fetch them.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:32.4852347\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1150,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：We\u0027ll get the wagons home. No giants required.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:32.5055309\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1151,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：The wagons are heading home. The knight is helping mend the fence he broke.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:32.5167279\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1152,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：How is the fence taking his apology?","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:32.5232952\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1153,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：Better than the chickens. I\u0027d like to travel with you. We work well together.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:32.5406505\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1154,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：Then we\u0027ll keep learning. One road and one battle at a time.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:32.5612749\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1155,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：There was a Bloodthorn Bolt tome in the stolen crate. We can study it. The trainer can explain the notes; Gines mostly drew skulls.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:32.5707685\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1156,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：So that\u0027s where he gets his big ideas.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:32.5801278\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1157,"kind":"notice","message":"李文秀 自由属性点 \u002B30","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-25T06:07:32.5904259\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{